## Hand-off readiness gates

Computed from the current bundle — answer questions about which hand-off waits for CI or
a conflict-free PR from this list.

- business-analyst → developer (issue channel, label `ready`): issue hand-off — cannot be gated (only PR hand-offs can)
- developer → code-reviewer (PR channel, label `ready-for-review`): not gated — wakes immediately
- code-reviewer → reworker (trigger `reworker-on-revisions-required`, label `revisions-required`): not gated — wakes immediately
- code-reviewer → merger (trigger `merger-on-ready-to-merge`, label `ready-to-merge`): not gated — wakes immediately

